   "note": "OSRS's figures are per fish, so each one lives on its own fishing struct. The big net is the exception: the wiki gives one figure for big net fishing as an ACTIVITY, and one haul can bring up boots, seaweed, two mackerel, a cod and a bass at once, so it is rolled once per haul that caught something, out of a constant. The Fishing Trawler has its own figure too and is rolled once per game landed, since its net can only be pulled after a journey that finished. The lava eel, manta ray and sea turtle have no row on the wiki and so give no pet, as in OSRS."
